        </div>
      </div>
    ))}

    <div class="cs-comp-wide">
      <h3 class="cs-component-title">Navigation</h3>
      <p class="cs-component-desc">The desktop top bar keeps the main sections and the drug-price search one click away. On mobile, a top bar and a footer menu put the same destinations within thumb reach.</p>
