  <SectionContent title="The Mobile App">
    <div class="cs-body-text">
      <p>MedImpact was built for mobile as well as desktop. The app puts the same core tasks &mdash; checking a drug price, refilling a prescription, tracking doses, and managing benefits &mdash; in a layout made for a phone.</p>
    </div>

