  <hr class="cs-section-divider">

  <SectionContent title="Hi Fi Designs">
    {miShowcase.map((s, i) => (
      <div class="cs-hifi-annotated" style={i > 0 ? 'margin-top: clamp(52px, 12vw, 120px);' : ''}>
        <div class="cs-hifi-head">
          <h3 class="cs-hifi-title">{s.title}</h3>
          <p class="cs-hifi-desc">{s.desc}</p>
          <blockquote class="cs-hifi-quote">{s.comment}</blockquote>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-annotated-wrap">
          <div class="cs-annotated-left">
            {s.leftCards.map((c) => (<div class="cs-annotated-card" style={`top:${c.top}%`}><h4>{c.h}</h4><p>{c.p}</p></div>))}
          </div>
          <div class="cs-annotated-center">
            <img src={s.src} alt={s.title} width={s.w} height={s.h} class="cs-annotated-img" loading="lazy" />
            {s.leftCards.map((c) => (<span class="cs-dot cs-dot--miL" style={`top:${c.top}%`}></span>))}
            {s.rightCards.map((c) => (<span class="cs-dot cs-dot--miR" style={`top:${c.top}%`}></span>))}
          </div>
          <div class="cs-annotated-right">
            {s.rightCards.map((c) => (<div class="cs-annotated-card" style={`top:${c.top}%`}><h4>{c.h}</h4><p>{c.p}</p></div>))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    ))}

    <div class="mi-rest">
      {miRest.map((f) => (
        <div class="mi-group">
          <h3 class="cs-subsection-title">{f.name}</h3>
          {f.desktop.length > 0 && (
            <>
              <p class="mi-variant">Desktop</p>
              <div class="mi-shots">
                {f.desktop.map((img) => (<figure class="mi-shot"><img src={img.src} alt={img.alt} width={img.w} height={img.h} loading="lazy" /></figure>))}
              </div>
            </>
          )}
          {f.mobile.length > 0 && (
            <>
              <p class="mi-variant">Mobile</p>
              <div class="mi-shots mi-shots--mobile">
                {f.mobile.map((img) => (<figure class="mi-shot mi-shot--mobile"><img src={img.src} alt={img.alt} width={img.w} height={img.h} loading="lazy" /></figure>))}
              </div>
            </>
          )}
          {f.name === "Claims History" && (
            <>
              <p class="mi-variant">Filters &amp; dropdowns</p>
              <div class="mi-dropdowns">
                {miClaimsDropdowns.map((img) => (<figure class:list={["mi-dropdown", img.src.includes("share") && "mi-dropdown--popup"]}><img src={img.src} alt={img.alt} width={img.w} height={img.h} loading="lazy" /></figure>))}
              </div>
            </>
          )}
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </SectionContent>

  <hr class="cs-section-divider">

  <SectionContent title="User Testing">
    <div class="cs-body-text">
      <p>I ran moderated usability tests with 5 participants to validate the core member tasks. Each session lasted about 25 minutes and followed a structured test guide. I tracked completion rate, error rate, time to success, and satisfaction, then assigned severity ratings (1 = cosmetic, 4 = must fix) to prioritize what needed attention.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cs-testing-metrics">
      <div class="cs-metric-card"><span class="cs-metric-number">5</span><span class="cs-metric-label">Participants</span></div>
      <div class="cs-metric-card"><span class="cs-metric-number">7</span><span class="cs-metric-label">Tasks Tested</span></div>
      <div class="cs-metric-card"><span class="cs-metric-number">89%</span><span class="cs-metric-label">Completion Rate</span></div>
      <div class="cs-metric-card"><span class="cs-metric-number">25 min</span><span class="cs-metric-label">Avg. Session</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="cs-body-text" style="margin-top: clamp(30px, 6.4vw, 64px);">
      <h3 class="cs-subsection-title">Task Results</h3>
    </div>

    <div class="cs-testing-table-wrap">
      <table class="cs-testing-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th class="cs-testing-th--task">Task</th>
            <th>U1</th><th>U2</th><th>U3</th><th>U4</th><th>U5</th>
            <th>Rate</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td class="cs-testing-td--task">Look up a drug's price and compare it across nearby pharmacies.</td>
            <td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td>
            <td class="cs-testing-td--rate">5/5</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="cs-testing-td--task">Switch the pharmacy used for pricing and confirm the price updates.</td>
            <td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--iterate" title="Delayed"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td>
            <td class="cs-testing-td--rate">4/5</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="cs-testing-td--task">Refill a prescription from the My Prescriptions list.</td>
            <td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td>
            <td class="cs-testing-td--rate">5/5</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="cs-testing-td--task">Filter claims history by date range and drug to find a specific claim.</td>
            <td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--iterate" title="Delayed"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td>
            <td class="cs-testing-td--rate">4/5</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="cs-testing-td--task">Find a recommended vaccine and locate a nearby pharmacy to get it.</td>
            <td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td>
            <td class="cs-testing-td--rate">5/5</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="cs-testing-td--task">Compare two plans during open enrollment.</td>
            <td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--iterate" title="Delayed"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--iterate" title="Delayed"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td>
            <td class="cs-testing-td--rate cs-testing-td--rate-low">3/5</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="cs-testing-td--task">Share a claims record with a caregiver by email.</td>
            <td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass" title="Pass"></span></td><td><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--iterate" title="Delayed"></span></td>
            <td class="cs-testing-td--rate">4/5</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="cs-testing-legend">
      <div class="cs-legend-item"><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--pass"></span> Pass</div>
      <div class="cs-legend-item"><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--iterate"></span> Delayed</div>
      <div class="cs-legend-item"><span class="cs-test-dot cs-test-dot--fail"></span> Failed</div>
    </div>

    <div class="cs-body-text" style="margin-top: clamp(30px, 6.4vw, 64px);">
      <h3 class="cs-subsection-title">Key Findings</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="cs-findings-grid">
      <div class="cs-finding-card cs-finding-card--sev3">
        <div class="cs-finding-header">
          <span class="cs-finding-severity cs-finding-severity--3">Severity 3</span>
          <span class="cs-finding-tag">Must Fix</span>
        </div>
        <h3><svg class="cs-ico" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" /><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="8" y2="12" /><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="16" y2="16" /></svg>Starting a Plan Comparison</h3>
        <p>2 of 5 participants weren't sure how to begin comparing plans during open enrollment. We added a clearer entry point and a short prompt noting that up to three plans can be compared at once.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-finding-card cs-finding-card--sev2">
        <div class="cs-finding-header">
          <span class="cs-finding-severity cs-finding-severity--2">Severity 2</span>
          <span class="cs-finding-tag">Improve</span>
        </div>
        <h3><svg class="cs-ico" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.106-3.105c.32-.322.863-.22.983.218a6 6 0 0 1-8.259 7.057l-7.91 7.91a1 1 0 0 1-2.999-3l7.91-7.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.057-8.259c.438.12.54.662.219.984z" /></svg>Pharmacy Switch Feedback</h3>
        <p>1 participant didn't notice that prices had updated after switching pharmacy. We added a brief highlight on the updated prices so the change is easy to catch.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-finding-card cs-finding-card--sev1">
        <div class="cs-finding-header">
          <span class="cs-finding-severity cs-finding-severity--1">Severity 1</span>
          <span class="cs-finding-tag">Cosmetic</span>
        </div>
        <h3><svg class="cs-ico" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z" /><path d="M20 2v4" /><path d="M22 4h-4" /><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2" /></svg>Removable Filter Pills</h3>
        <p>1 participant didn't realize the keyword filter pills on Claims History could be removed. We added a clear remove affordance and a short tooltip.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </SectionContent>

  <hr class="cs-section-divider">

